    "items": {
      "t1": {
        "quote": "Entlelo yamisa umsebenzi wokugcina umkhawulo wasekhaya lomunye wethu ngeClear Vu kanye nezinhlangozi. Umsebenzi wathutha ngokusho kwabo, ukufinyelela kwamakhala kuyaqinisekile, kanye nekhawulo akashadli. Abantu bethu basekuhlonisheni baze bafuna ukusebenza nabo futhi.",
        "role": "Umuntu owasekhaya"
      },
      "t2": {
        "quote": "Njengomqambi thina, thina sizama abasebenzi ababamba umsebenzi. Entlelo yathutha izinhlelo zethu zokugcina kanye nezinhlangozi zokukhetha ngokuhamba kwemiklamo, ngokungekhona ukukhansela imisebenzo yezinye. Izinhlelo zawo zokuphucula umsebenzi kanye nezinhlaka zokuvikela zizame ukusebenza kwesisekelo samasebenzi wethu.",
        "role": "Umphathi wezindaba zokukhetha"
      },
      "t3": {
        "quote": "Izinhlangozo zokukhetha zathutha ngokuhlakanipha, ziqashwe ngamakhadi, kanye ziqinisekiswa ngosuku. Uma sithanda ukubheka kwezinkanyezi ezincane zabasebenzi bezokubhukuda, bathutha isikhathi esingu-24. Umsebenzi oqavile ukusuka ekhawuleni kuya ekususweni.",
        "role": "Umphathi wezisebenzi"
      },
      "t4": {
        "quote": "Babuyise inhlangozo yethu yegate yeshope eluhlaza kanye nezinhlaka ezintsha zokuvikela ngosuku lapho thina sabiza khona. Inani eliqinisekile lokunyathelwa kanye nokufinyelela kwakho kumuhle. Siphila ukuvikele inkampani entsha yabantu abamnyama ephethe umsebenzi oqavile njengoba kuwukho.",
        "role": "Business Owner"
      }
    }
